OL,3,GNEWSATour bus hits Trafalgar Square
OL,4,Asouvenir stand
OL,5,
OL,6,FA double-decker tour bus has crashed
OL,7,Finto a souvenir stand in central
OL,8,FLondon.
OL,10,FThe Metropolitan Police was called to
OL,11,FSpring Gardens, off Trafalgar Square,
OL,12,Fto the "damage-only collision".
OL,14,FAn eyewitness to the crash, who works
OL,15,Fat The Admiralty pub on the corner of
OL,16,FSpring Gardens, said the hop-on,
OL,17,Fhop-off bus run by Golden Tours hit a
OL,18,Flamppost and knocked it over, before
OL,19,Fstriking the stall and pushing it into
OL,20,Fa Land Rover.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
